<mxCell id="note" value="Blue: independent application   Green: independent database   Grey: code / operational boundary&#xa;No shared client database or cross-client appointment store. Separate physical machines are not prescribed. Client-managed and provider-managed hosting remain possible; technical custody is not permission to access records. Backups require tested restoration and approved real-backup verification before reliance." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="670" width="1260" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
